    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="80709d76-e27e-544b-a417-a3c631339f80" activityNameId="46e21806-d75b-52b2-a251-d3abcb9ed5ba" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Frame extension, PVC, at plant, with resource correction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Frame extension, PVC, at plant, with resource correction
The frame extension is 0.07m thick, U=0.4W/m2K. 1m2 of frame extension weighs 15kg. The bill of materials is based on data from frame extension manufactures.;
UUID: f870d6e1-16fd-3561-9aab-f041f538ed98
Included are the materials used in a frame extension. The cover plate is PVC. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at frame extenstion manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f870d6e1-16fd-3561-9aab-f041f538ed98.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
